title: "OREVID: Open Repurposing Evidence"
abstract: "An open knowledge-graph tool that ranks existing drugs for each disease, shows the evidence behind every candidate, and an honest, reproducible drug-repurposing benchmark (OREVID-bench) with TxGNN run on the same splits."
